      "message": "fix(ai): use installed local models and current cloud defaults\n\nDiscover installed Ollama models before the first automatic Send.\nProbe tool support and refuse unusable discovery replies with named diagnostics.\nKeep explicit model names and each preset's fallback mode.\nShare the cloud defaults and reject retired defaults in the catalog test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\nFixes #3782",
